  I ready my blade, eyes fixed on the ground.  Normally, Muramasa would be correct.

  But not in this weather. The rain will play havoc with our sensors.

  In such conditions, an aerial engagement becomes a matter of luck more than skill. I suspect this is why Ichijo kept her wings folded, even though her weapon is advantaged in the air.

  I also have no desire to gamble. And even if I had―

pt:
